Package: BiocPropagate
Title: Validate Bioconductor Package Versions and Build Status via R-Universe
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Marcel", "Ramos", , "marcel.ramos@sph.cuny.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides tools for validating Bioconductor packages through the
    r-universe ecosystem. Functions check for version consistency between a
    local package and its r-universe counterpart, enforce proper version bump
    rules, and report build and check status across platforms.
License: Artistic-2.0
Imports:
    BiocManager,
    glue,
    jsonlite,
    rjsoncons
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Collate: 
    'api.R'
    'filters.R'
    'runiverse_status.R'
    'runiverse_valid.R'
